        "hero_title": "Comac Scrubber Dryers",
        "hero_desc": "Robust and reliable, Comac are a longstanding brand in the world of cleaning. Known for their high quality floor scrubber dryers, Comac lead the line in driving efficiency, results, and sustainability in cleaning.",
